Name: Robolectric
URL: http://robolectric.org
Version: 17-robolectric-15733970
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: no
License Android Compatible: yes
Description: Robolectric is a unit test framework for Android.
Local Modifications:
How To Update:
- First CL:
  - Add new version and URL to 3pp/fetch.py for the android_all jar.
  - Update the old versions to the latest instrumented versioned files
    for backwards compatibility.
  - Check for a newer version of nativeruntime-dist-compat.jar
  - Upload & submit a CL without DEPS and BUILD.gn changes.
- Kickoff 3pp run:
  - Trigger: https://luci-scheduler.appspot.com/jobs/chromium/3pp-linux-amd64-packager
  - Trigger: https://luci-scheduler.appspot.com/jobs/chromium/3pp-mac-arm64-packager
- Second CL:
  - Add new version(s) as data to third_party/robolectric/BUILD.gn.
  - Update DEPS to point to new version tag (found from:
    https://chrome-infra-packages.appspot.com/p/chromium/third_party/robolectric/linux-amd64)
  - Update Version: in this README.chromium
